# Names of the settings this Worker reads when it runs locally (pnpm dev:sandbox). No values here, ever.
# Real values are written to a git-ignored .dev.vars file by scripts/Write-DevVars.ps1 (docs/09_ENV_KeyMappings.md).
# The tool sandbox's signing secret: the same value as apps/api/.dev.vars, so sandbox secrets made by the local API work here.
KR_TOOL_SANDBOX_SECRET=
